DESCRIPTION:Cirque Kalabanté brings traditional African movement and musi
 c into the Montreal circus arts tradition with WOW (World of Words)\, a ne
 w production exploring the transmission of knowledge\, the meeting of cult
 ures\, and the magic of shared respect. The troupe is led by Yamoussa Bang
 oura\, a multidisciplinary artist of Guinean origin who realized his dream
  by founding a school of circus arts and directing a company specializing 
 in African arts.\nCategory: Performing Arts\nOriginal listing: https://eve
