CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Art + Design\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Join MODA for a virtual studio and design a travel collection 
 featuring an imaginary winter destination. In this virtual studio\, young 
 designers will explore how travel posters and postage stamps use illustrat
 ion\, typography\, and bold compositions to inspire people to visit new pl
 aces. Students will invent a magical winter destination such as a crystal 
 forest\, snowy kingdom\, frozen waterfall\, or floating ice island. Using 
 Canva\, they will create either a travel poster or a coordinated stamp col
 lection that captures the atmosphere of their winter wonderland. At the en
 d of the studio\, students can share their work and receive feedback in a 
 supportive environment.\nCategory: Art + Design\nOriginal listing: https:/
 /www.artsatl.org/event/graphic-design-studio-winter-travels/
